## Malcontent integration

This product interoperates with the separately installed Malcontent parental
controls service through documented public D-Bus and AccountsService APIs.  It
does not include, modify, or redistribute Malcontent source code or libraries.
Malcontent is a system dependency supplied by the operating-system
distribution and is licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later.  Its copyright notices, source
code, and license are provided by that distribution.  Oh No! Parent Control is
not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Malcontent authors or
the GNOME project.

Malcontent is one enforcement component, not a guarantee that every possible
way of using a computer or application is blocked.  Administrators remain
responsible for configuring the computer appropriately for their family and
for reviewing the product documentation before relying on a restriction.

